ClusterBox start page: an add-on with nav placement "home" (the
ClusterBox add-on) is the first menu entry and the page MoCI opens
without a route; the MoCI dashboard stays as "BMC". The dashboard poll
(every 3 s) only starts when the dashboard is shown: opened on another
route it ran in the background until the first route change. An add-on
may contribute a list to one extension point (several network tabs).
The VPN tab is named WIREGUARD (the ClusterBox add-on adds OPENVPN).

